{"id":"n58547-1-8","stage":3,"title":"변비 · 便秘","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58547-1-8-1","ko":"변을 못 본지 오래됐어요.","zh":"我好久没排便了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"변을","meaning":"便","explanation":"변：便；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"변","audio":"/audio/d1a537bb70f1b6f2466c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58216","senseId":"1","lemma":"변","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"본지","meaning":"解手，方便；从那时起，从那以后","explanation":"보다：解手，方便；지：从那时起，从那以后；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"},{"term":"지","audio":"/audio/32e608b594bece7ab3a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"19","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"91881","senseId":"1","lemma":"지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오래됐어요.","meaning":"久，老","explanation":"오래되다：久，老；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오래되다","audio":"/audio/7d268ef946cccd3a8e4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89515","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d1a537bb70f1b6f2","term":"변","zh":"便","audio":"/audio/d1a537bb70f1b6f2466c.mp3","entryId":"58216","definition":"屎和尿；主要指屎。","pronunciation":["변"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"解手，方便","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"(委婉)大小便。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"32e608b594bece7a","term":"지","zh":"从那时起，从那以后","audio":"/audio/32e608b594bece7ab3a3.mp3","entryId":"91881","definition":"表示从某事发生到现在。","pronunciation":["지"]},{"id":"7d268ef946cccd3a","term":"오래되다","zh":"久，老","audio":"/audio/7d268ef946cccd3a8e4b.mp3","entryId":"89515","definition":"开始或发生后，经过的时间长。","pronunciation":["오래되다","오래뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9f374ef40800da9fa915.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58547-1-8-2","ko":"채소와 과일을 많이 먹으면 변비에 도움이 돼요.","zh":"多吃蔬菜和水果有助于缓解便秘。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"채소와","meaning":"菜，蔬菜","explanation":"채소：菜，蔬菜；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"채소","audio":"/audio/2193870aa946b1dfff09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72036","senseId":"1","lemma":"채소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"과일을","meaning":"水果","explanation":"과일：水果；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18264","senseId":"1","lemma":"과일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹으면","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"변비에","meaning":"便秘","explanation":"변비：便秘；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"변비","audio":"/audio/8ff00411e105f07b7dfc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58547","senseId":"1","lemma":"변비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도움이","meaning":"帮助，帮忙，援助","explanation":"도움：帮助，帮忙，援助；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"도움","audio":"/audio/8d901cc28dffe7ee0af6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64542","senseId":"1","lemma":"도움","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2193870aa946b1df","term":"채소","zh":"菜，蔬菜","audio":"/audio/2193870aa946b1dfff09.mp3","entryId":"72036","definition":"栽种在田里的、茎叶或果实可食用的农作物。","pronunciation":["채ː소"]},{"id":"ed0e90733d1a21cf","term":"과일","zh":"水果","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3","entryId":"18264","definition":"苹果、梨、葡萄、栗子等主要长在树上的，人们可以食用的果子。","pronunciation":["과ː일"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"8ff00411e105f07b","term":"변비","zh":"便秘","audio":"/audio/8ff00411e105f07b7dfc.mp3","entryId":"58547","definition":"大便在大肠中堆积的时间较长、不容易排泄出来的症状。","pronunciation":["변비"]},{"id":"8d901cc28dffe7ee","term":"도움","zh":"帮助，帮忙，援助","audio":"/audio/8d901cc28dffe7ee0af6.mp3","entryId":"64542","definition":"帮扶他人的事宜。","pronunciation":["도움"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/141f6f40c2bdf209c5a7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.15,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58547","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":114,"sequenceScore":2.9767,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["多吃蔬菜和水果有助于缓解便秘。","我好久没排便了。","把书放到一边去吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我好久没排便了。","把书放到一边去吧。","多吃蔬菜和水果有助于缓解便秘。"],"answer":2}]}
